thought_1 = Gender roles can be seen as social constructs that may vary greatly depending on cultural and societal contexts;
thought_2 = Some societies have more rigid and traditional views on gender roles, while others, like modern Westernized ones, tend to promote gender equality and individuality;
thought_3 = In general, these roles often suggest that both women and men can achieve high levels of success and fulfillment in their personal and professional lives regardless of traditional gender norms.
